 "sentences": [
  {
   "sid": "6-11.s1",
   "text": "And here's what the end of that road can look like.",
   "w_first": "6-11.w001",
   "w_last": "6-11.w011",
   "f0": 4,
   "f1": 145
  },
  {
   "sid": "6-11.s2",
   "text": "Some AI-assisted cancer drugs have walked much further.",
   "w_first": "6-11.w012",
   "w_last": "6-11.w019",
   "f0": 174,
   "f1": 370
  },
  {
   "sid": "6-11.s3",
   "text": "In September 2026, one of them, lirafugratinib, was approved in the US for a bile duct cancer.",
   "w_first": "6-11.w020",
   "w_last": "6-11.w036",
   "f0": 399,
   "f1": 905
  },
  {
   "sid": "6-11.s4",
   "text": "Others failed along the way.",
   "w_first": "6-11.w037",
   "w_last": "6-11.w041",
   "f0": 934,
   "f1": 1035
  },
  {
   "sid": "6-11.s5",
   "text": "And 048?",
   "w_first": "6-11.w042",
   "w_last": "6-11.w043",
   "f0": 1064,
   "f1": 1115
  },
  {
   "sid": "6-11.s6",
   "text": "Its makers chose not to take it to trials, and shared it with other researchers instead.",
   "w_first": "6-11.w044",
   "w_last": "6-11.w059",
   "f0": 1144,
   "f1": 1474
  }
 ],
